ally wants to achieve at a business level. Focus on the end goal, not just the task they mentioned.\n\n2. Core Problem\nWhat main problem is the client trying to solve?\n\n3. Pain Points\nList the specific pain points the client is experiencing. These may include operational issues, inefficiencies, lack of integration, manual work, scalability issues, etc.\n\n4. Hidden Needs\nIdentify needs that the client may not have explicitly mentioned but are likely required to solve the problem properly.\n\n5. Recommended Solution\nProvide a high level solution approach that addresses the problem and pain points.\n\n6. Possible Technical Approach\nSuggest tools, platforms, or architecture that could be used to implement the solution.\n\n7. Business Impact\nExplain how solving this problem will benefit the client’s business (efficiency, automation, revenue growth, cost reduction, etc.)\n\"","options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":3.1,"position":[-6416,-288],"id":"5b0eb349-f1a2-4d0d-b76e-cf541523d076","name":"AI Agent1"},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Get stringified JSON\nconst raw = $json.body.webhookTrigger;\n\n// Convert string to object\nconst parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n\n// Extract payload\nconst payload = parsed.payload;\n\n// Return clean data\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      title: payload.title,\n      description: payload.description,\n      url: payload.url,\n      score: payload.score,\n      budget: payload.budget,\n      budgetDisplay: payload.budgetDisplay,\n      clientLocation: payload.clientLocation,\n      paymentVerified: payload.paymentVerified,\n      projectType: payload.projectType,\n      postedTime: payload.postedTime,\n      proposalCount: payload.proposalCount,\n      jobId: payload.jobId,\n      skills: payload.skills,\n      scoreReasons: payload.scoreReasons\n    }\n  }\n];"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-7440,112],"id":"f6991d59-f759-4130-b808-fbbbcb2227ff","name":"Code in JavaScript"},{"para