 solution strategy.\n\nImportant Rules:\n- Do NOT use typical ChatGPT formatting.\n- Do NOT add explanations outside the JSON.\n- Do NOT add markdown.\n- Do NOT add headings or commentary.\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Be concise but insightful.\n- Infer hidden needs when possible.\n\nAnalyze the job post and produce the following structured JSON output.\n\nJSON Structure:\n\n{\n  \"customer_intent\": \"\",\n  \"core_problem\": \"\",\n  \"pain_points\": [],\n  \"hidden_needs\": [],\n  \"desired_outcomes\": [],\n  \"recommended_solution\": \"\",\n  \"technical_approach\": {\n    \"platforms\": [],\n    \"integrations\": [],\n    \"architecture\": \"\",\n    \"automation_opportunities\": []\n  },\n  \"project_complexity\": \"\",\n  \"estimated_scope\": \"\",\n  \"risks_or_challenges\": [],\n  \"discovery_questions\": [],\n  \"proposal_strategy\": \"\",\n  \"business_impact\": \"\",\n  \"keywords_from_job_post\": []\n}\n\nGuidelines for extraction:\n\ncustomer_intent:\nIdentify the real goal the client wants to achieve beyond the technical task.\n\ncore_problem:\nDefine the main operational or technical problem.\n\npain_points:\nList concrete frustrations, inefficiencies, or blockers mentioned or implied.\n\nhidden_needs:\nIdentify needs that the client likely has but did not clearly state.\n\ndesired_outcomes:\nWhat success looks like for the client.\n\nrecommended_solution:\nProvide a high-level solution strategy.\n\ntechnical_approach:\nSuggest implementation direction including tools, platforms, or integrations.\n\nproject_complexity:\nReturn one of: \"Low\", \"Medium\", \"High\", \"Very High\"\n\nestimated_scope:\nShort description such as \"Small integration task\", \"Multi-system automation project\", etc.\n\nrisks_or_challenges:\nTechnical or business risks that could affect delivery.\n\ndiscovery_questions:\nImportant questions that should be asked before starting.\n\nproposal_strategy:\nSuggest how a freelancer should position their proposal to win the project.\n\nbusiness_impact:\nExplain how solving this will benefit the client.\n\nkeywords_from_job_post:\nExtract the most important technical and business keywords.\n\n\n\"","options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":3.1,"position":[-6768,0],"id":"f3c1f763-b9ed-4e85-b91a-54671d2be7df","name":"AI Agent2"},{"parameters":{"options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","typeVersion":1,"position":[-6336,-64],"id":"a7f593b6-a108-460d-92be-f59a7b0b4d47","name":"Google Gemini Chat Model","credentials":{"googlePalmApi":{"id":"uafX6mHyKr8hrAAg","name":"Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account Ahtsham"}}},{"parameters":{"options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","typeVersion":1,"position":[-6704,224],"id":"f2d92cde-613b-4516-8f71-5868e8518915","name":"Google Gemini Chat Model1"},{"parameters":{"url":"=http://localhost:5678/api/v1/workflows/{{ $workflow.id }}","sendHeaders":true,"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"X-N8N-API-KEY","value":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1ZjJkMDAyYy0xN2Q5LTRjNDgtYmRhNC1jMjM0NTI3ZWU4ZTAiLCJpc3MiOiJuOG4iLCJhdWQiOiJwdWJsaWMtYXBpIiwianRpIjoiYzVjNjllZTctMTM2ZS00NGY0LWIyMDUtYWJjZTAzZTE3YWMyIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg4MDMyNzUyfQ.7svJDhYrRPR_uAzGd_m7bVe-I7XG10nawOJSKYkjajI"}]},"options":{"redirect":{"redirect":{}},"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"file"}}}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.4,"position":[-7840,-224],"id":"0cb59bec-7eb9-42f0-bf3c-5ce566e40d0b","name":"workflow json fetch","executeOnce":true},{"parameters":{"operation":"uploadFile","resource_type_file":"raw","additionalFieldsFile":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-cloudinary.cloudinary","typeVersion":2,"position":[-7616,-320],"id":"27364d7b-7725-467c-9bf6-683db33338a7","name":"Upload an json asset","credentials":{"cloudinaryApi":{"id":"Y5TBWroYo4TEG4VX","name":"Cloudinary account"}},"onError":"continueRegularOutput"},{"parameters":{},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","typeVersion":3.2,"position":[-7392,-224],"id"